  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This spacious 3-bedroom vacation rental is nestled in a peaceful neighborhood, yet steps away from 30A upscale restaurants, shops, and outdoor entertainment. The home features a community pool, cozy fire pit, 4 Bikes, and easy access to pristine public beaches. Bike to Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach. It's perfect for families or groups of up to 10 guests. <br><br>After a day of exploring Inlet Beach's pristine beaches, shops, local restaurants, outdoor activities, or the 30A Farmers' Market. Guests can unwind by the community pool, roast marshmallows by the fire pit, or socialize on the screened porch with a rocking or swinging chair. <br><br>Guest Access:<br>Entire house, 3Bed/2.5Bath <br><br>Highlights:<br>* Walk or Bike to three public beaches<br>* Community Pool (heated during winter months)<br>* Complimentary Bikes<br>* Complimentary WiFi, up to 1Gig<br>* 3 parking spaces<br>* Fully equipped kitchen<br>* Coffee Bar <br>* Games and arcades<br>* Washer and dryer<br>* BBQ grill<br>* Beach Essential<br>* Fire Pit<br><br>Three public beach access:<br>1. Inlet Beach Regional Beach Access (9 miles away, 3 min drive). This access has parking 117 parking spaces, three dune walkovers, restrooms, and lifeguards during peak season. <br>2. Winston Lane Public Beach (.6 miles away, 14 min walk). This access has no public parking, just bike racks. <br>3. Wall Street Beach Access: (.8 miles away, 3 min drive). This access has no public parking, just bike racks.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Prime Location! Next to upscale 30A, Walk/Bike to Beach, Shop and Restaurants."
        }
      ],
